    "body": "I think it is defined. In that case steps step 2 of the subsequent algorithm,\n\n> If there is a sequential focus navigation starting point defined and it is inside starting point, then let starting point be the sequential focus navigation starting point instead.\n\nsimply fails to trigger (the \"if\" is false). So the sequential focus navigation starting point is not used when moving focus.\n",
