    "updated_at": "2016-05-05T19:30:46Z",
    "body": "What happens if the focused node is `null`?\n\nChrome moves the sequential focus navigation starting point to an ancestor if it's removed from the tree, and [we're planning to do the same](https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=116046).\n",
