    "updated_at": "2016-05-05T19:36:23Z",
    "body": "Hmm, I see. I'm still not entirely sure if this is about the sequential focus navigation starting point or about the currently focused area of the browsing context, but you have probably looked at this more than me.\n\nFWIW the currently focused area of the browsing context is taken care of by \"When the currently focused area of a top-level browsing context was a focusable area but stops being a focusable area...\". I guess we'd want to have similar steps for the sequential focus navigation starting point...\n",
